mcp-server-redmine (2.4.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Rename source/binary package from redmine-mcp-server to
    mcp-server-redmine, matching the mcp-server-<name> convention, with
    a new mcprack-mcp-server-redmine companion package that registers
    it (stdio mode, REDMINE_MCP_TRANSPORT=stdio) into the local mcprack
    catalog. Old package name kept as Provides/Replaces/Breaks.
  * Bump vendored typing-extensions from 4.14.1 to 4.16.0: the older
    copy shadowed the system package via PYTHONPATH but lacked the
    `sentinel` symbol anyio's typed-attribute helpers import, causing
    the service to crash-loop with ImportError at startup.

 -- vitex <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 14:15:00 +0200

redmine-mcp-server (2.4.0.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Switch dep uvicorn -> python3-uvicorn; drop unused python3-fastapi
    (coinstallable with mcprack)
  * Add stdio transport (REDMINE_MCP_TRANSPORT=stdio), for local
    single-user use (e.g. Claude Code) via `mcp.run(transport="stdio")`.
    Rejects oauth/oauth-proxy auth modes, matching the restriction
    nextcloud-mcp-server uses for its own stdio mode.

 -- vitex <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 13:00:00 +0200

